### Flujo completo de facturación
### VS Code: extensión REST Client · IntelliJ: HTTP Client

@host = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Token
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin12345"
}

###
@token = {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 2. Cliente
# @name customer
POST {{host}}/api/customers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Acme SL",
  "email": "facturas@acme.es",
  "taxId": "B12345678"
}

### 3. Factura en borrador
# @name invoice
POST {{host}}/api/invoices
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "{{customer.response.body.id}}",
  "currency": "EUR",
  "lines": [
    { "description": "Consultoría", "quantity": 2, "unitPrice": 50.00, "vatRate": 0.21 },
    { "description": "Licencia anual", "quantity": 1, "unitPrice": 30.00, "vatRate": 0.10 }
  ]
}

### 4. Emitir
POST {{host}}/api/invoices/{{invoice.response.body.id}}/issue
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Pago parcial (idempotente)
POST {{host}}/api/invoices/{{invoice.response.body.id}}/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: pago-001
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 100.00 }

### 6. Repetir la misma petición: devuelve el pago original
POST {{host}}/api/invoices/{{invoice.response.body.id}}/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: pago-001
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 100.00 }

### 7. Liquidar
POST {{host}}/api/invoices/{{invoice.response.body.id}}/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: pago-002
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 54.00 }

### 8. Detalle
GET {{host}}/api/invoices/{{invoice.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9. Sobrepago (400)
POST {{host}}/api/invoices/{{invoice.response.body.id}}/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: pago-003
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 999.00 }
